"- Merge in the new chunk without losing constraints, decisions, or pending "
"items.\n"
msgstr ""
"- Gabungkan bahagian baharu tanpa kehilangan kekangan, keputusan atau item "
"yang belum selesai.\n"

msgid "- Keep the result concise and suitable for a system message."
msgstr "- Pastikan keputusan ringkas dan sesuai untuk mesej sistem."

